Instrument samples in this directory
=====================================

Files:
  clarinet-mp3.js
  french_horn-mp3.js
  string_ensemble_1-mp3.js
  timpani-mp3.js

Source:
  https://github.com/gleitz/midi-js-soundfonts/tree/gh-pages/FluidR3_GM

These are pre-rendered single-note samples in MIDI.js format, generated from
the FluidR3_GM SoundFont created by Frank Wen. The MIDI.js Soundfonts project
publishes the Fluid Soundfont under the Creative Commons Attribution 3.0
license:

  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/

Attribution: "FluidR3_GM SoundFont by Frank Wen, via the MIDI.js Soundfonts
project (CC BY 3.0)."

The music sequenced with these instruments in Rogue0 is original to this
project. It is not the melody, orchestration or any leitmotif from Sergei
Prokofiev's "Peter and the Wolf"; only the idea of associating characters with
instruments is borrowed.

The browser loader (the npm package `soundfont-player`) is MIT licensed; its
license text ships with the installed dependency.
